cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use oasis_dm in published work, please cite it as below."
title: "oasis_dm: density modification for macromolecular crystallography"
abstract: >-
  A self-contained density-modification (phase-improvement) engine: solvent
  masking, histogram matching, Hendrickson-Lattman phase recombination and
  free-set driven stopping, with no CCP4 program calls.
authors:
  - family-names: Ding
    given-names: Wei
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/WeiDing535/oasis-dm"
keywords:
  - density modification
  - phase improvement
  - crystallography
  - SAD
  - macromolecular
version: 2.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-21"
